    "grammar": "### 1. 限制與限定句型 little more than (Little More Than)\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 同義語意代換 | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `S + be + little more than + N` | ...shopping is **little more than** a daily chore. | `nothing more than`, `only`, `no more than` (只不過是) | ↳ 對他而言，這份工作只不過是賺錢的手段。<br>➔ For him, this job is **little more than** a way to earn money. |\n\n---\n\n### 2. 形容詞片語後置修飾名詞 (Post-positive Adjectives)\n\n| 句型結構 | 課文原句 | 還原對照 (關係代名詞) | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `N + adj-able/ible + 修飾片語` | ...a complex digital platform **accessible** from our pockets. | ...a complex digital platform **which/that is accessible** from... | ↳ 他們嘗試尋找所有可用的解決方案。<br>➔ They tried to find all solutions **available** at the moment. |\n\n---\n\n### 3. 關係副詞 where 引導的非限制性形容詞子句 (Relative Adverb \"Where\")\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 還原對照 (介係詞 ＋ 關代) | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `N, where + S + V...` | One-stop shopping—**where** everything was available under one roof—became... | ...One-stop shopping, **in which** everything was available... | ↳ 我們搬進了新大樓，那裡的生活非常方便。<br>➔ We moved into a new building, **where** life is very convenient. |"
