    "grammar": "### 1. 條件與假設句型 in the event of (In the Event Of)\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 同義引申子句 | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `in the event of + N` | ...**in the event of** a fire—a finely tuned... | `in the event that + S + V` (萬一/如果發生) | ↳ 萬一發生緊急情況，請使用安全出口。<br>➔ **In the event of** an emergency, please use the safety exit. |\n\n---\n\n### 2. 動詞 Spare 的免除用法 (Spare from)\n\n| 句型結構 | 課文原句 | 類似結構對照 | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `spare + O + from + N/V-ing` | ...**sparing** millions of wearers **from** dealing with... | `save/prevent + O + from + V-ing` (使免受/避免) | ↳ 戴安全帽可以使騎乘者免受嚴重傷害。<br>➔ Wearing a helmet can **spare** riders **from** serious injuries. |\n\n---\n\n### 3. anything but 與 nothing but 的對照 (Anything But vs Nothing But)\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 語意對照 | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `anything but + Adj/N` | ...its impacts are **anything but** [distant]. | **絕非；一點也不** (＝ not... at all) | ↳ 他的回答絕非誠實。<br>➔ His answer was **anything but** honest. |\n| `nothing but + N/V` | (無) | **僅僅是；只有** (＝ only) | ↳ 他整天只會抱怨。<br>➔ He did **nothing but** complain all day. |"
