    "grammar": "### 1. 介係詞片語與分詞置於句首的倒裝 (Inversion with Prepositional Phrases & Participles)\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 還原對照 (常規語序) | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **介係詞片語置首**：<br>`Prep-phrase + be + S` | **Among the most famous were** Anne Boleyn and... | Anne Boleyn and... **were among the most famous**. | ↳ 山腳下坐落著一個寧靜的小村莊。<br>➔ **At the foot of the mountain lies** a peaceful village. |\n| **分詞置首**：<br>`V-ing/V-ed + be + S` | **Guarding the tower are** the famous Yeoman Warders... | The famous Yeoman Warders... **are guarding the tower**. | ↳ 抽屜裡藏著那把丟失的鑰匙。<br>➔ **Hidden in the drawer is** the lost key. |\n\n---\n\n### 2. 虛受詞句型 Legend has it that (Legend Has It That)\n\n| 句型結構 | 課文原句 | 虛受詞說明 | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Legend + has it + that-子句` | **Legend has it that** if the ravens ever leave, both... | `it` 作為**虛受詞**，代替後方由 `that` 引導的完整名詞子句。 | ↳ 傳說這個湖裡住著一隻神秘的怪物。<br>➔ **Legend has it that** a mysterious monster lives in this lake. |\n\n---\n\n### 3. 名詞後接分詞修飾結構 (Noun Modifying Participle)\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 還原對照 (形容詞子句) | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `N + V-ed (被動修飾)` | ...offer anyone **drawn** to royal history... | ...offer anyone **who is drawn** to royal history... (被吸引的人) | ↳ 被這個故事打動，她哭了起來。<br>➔ **Moved** by the story, she began to cry. |"
