    "grammar": "### 1. 分詞片語引導的狀語與後置修飾 (Double Participles: Located & Stretching)\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 還原對照 (關係子句) | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **被動置首**：<br>`V-ed..., S + V` | **Located** at the northern end..., the Arctic is... | **Because** the Arctic **is located** at... (被座落於) | ↳ 位於市中心的這家餐廳非常受歡迎。<br>➔ **Located** in the city center, this restaurant is popular. |\n| **主動後置**：<br>`N + V-ing...` | ...an ecosystem **stretching** across the Arctic Ocean... | ...an ecosystem **which stretches** across... (主動延伸) | ↳ 我們看到了一條穿過整座森林的小路。<br>➔ We saw a path **running** through the entire forest. |\n\n---\n\n### 2. 讓步從屬子句與 but 的排他規則 (Concession Clause with \"Though\")\n\n| 句型結構 | 課文原句 | 易錯提醒 | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Though + S + V, S + V` | **Though** the region may appear empty..., **it's actually** home to... | `Though` 或 `Although` 引導的讓步子句中，**主要子句絕不可與連接詞 but 連用**。 | ↳ 雖然天氣很冷，但他們還是去游泳了。<br>➔ **Although** the weather was cold, **[but]** they went swimming. (去除 but) |\n\n---\n\n### 3. 非限制性關係副詞 where 的連續用法 (Non-restrictive Relative Adverb \"Where\")\n\n| 核心結構 | 課文原句 | 介係詞代換對照 | 寫作實戰 (中譯英) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `N, where + S + V` | ...on sea ice, **where** they patiently hunt seals. | ...on sea ice, **on which** they patiently hunt seals. | ↳ 他們去了海灘，並在那裡待了一整天。<br>➔ They went to the beach, **where** they spent the whole day. |"
